{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:47 2026-09-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:47 2026-09-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:47 2026-09-02 HKT</p><img alt=\" 韋達與眾來賓替金豬開邊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/36b42a7bd3e6332d3e6f5e947ae49e07/2026-09/178834219792640.jpg\"/><p>今日韋達舉行馬房季前拜神儀式，多位騎師到場出席，包括布文、艾道拿、班德禮、霍宏聲、楊明綸、梁家俊、田泰安、金誠剛、希威森及奧爾民，場面相當熱鬧；到場馬主則有「顏色的顏」馬主顏為善及「蜜蜜送」馬主岑健龍等。</p><p>韋達先與馬房手足誠心上香，祈求今季事事順利。吉時一到，韋達與眾來賓大刀一揮替金豬開邊，祝今季成績節節上升。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img alt=\"「紫辰之星」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c1f62bd92ac93c0c1bf136357be6dc05/2026-09/178834225426375.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「蜜蜜送」馬主岑健龍（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d7d89709649b53d32c384e5fcc016e99/2026-09/178834225582478.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「顏色的顏」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9d4118b947810d95982eed64c0450ffb/2026-09/178834225551403.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"布文（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9318ba0b276df6e0668c9843892ce0c6/2026-09/178834225577899.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多位騎師現身撐場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f7ea9b20008d01ffa34e58741f0f8ff7/2026-09/178834225598902.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"艾道拿（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/537203ff4ff28f378c02216492a6502a/2026-09/178834225525416.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2d972d44abc5465f165d5f1af012eb45/2026-09/178834225584417.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"韋達與一眾馬房手足祈福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1f1067ee57925e28a3ed82db842b420/2026-09/178834225529322.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"開心合照\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6882b498603274a51695963fc3b85c9f/2026-09/178834225556592.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0662149517fad4a9203bf749eacd8db3/2026-09/178834225592515.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T10:04:02.887608+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}